#: ../../gas_laws/argon_molar_volume.rst:119
msgid "1,000原子のセルの体積 :math:`V_{\\mathrm{box}}` は、次の式で1 molあたりの体積、つまりモル体積へ換算します。"
msgstr ""
"The volume of the 1,000-atom cell, :math:`V_{\\mathrm{box}}`, is "
"converted to the volume per mole, that is, the molar volume, using the "
"following equation."

#: ../../gas_laws/argon_molar_volume.rst:121
